      "q": "Is the Castle Hill Service Centre accessible?",
      "a": "Yes, the centre offers wheelchair access, hearing loop, Auslan video remote interpreting, quiet hour, and remote live captioning. It is also located within a shopping centre and has on-site and undercover parking.",
